# Client ID of the multi-tenant Entra registration this build signs in with.
#
# Only needed to override the registration baked into
# `src/fno/built-in-client.ts` — for example when you host the tool yourself, or
# to point local development at a registration that lists `http://localhost:5173`
# as a Single-page application redirect URI. The shipped registration only lists
# the production origin.
#
# Users never see or enter Entra identifiers — a connection profile is just a
# name and an environment URL, and Connect opens the ordinary Microsoft sign-in.
#
# The value must belong to a *multi-tenant public client (SPA)* registration
# that has the delegated Dynamics ERP permission `CustomService.FullAccess`,
# and lists this build's origin as a Single-page application redirect URI (the
# plain origin, no path).
VITE_FNO_CLIENT_ID=
